## The admin package as the browser's half of an app sees it: the modules that use no platform
## (the tables admin's), which a page may show (`rocx generate --client` names this header there).
## `main.roc` has these and the server's pages (`JobsPage`, `AdminHtml`).
package [Admin, AdminPage, Catalog, Form, Listing, Look, Paging, Sql, View, Widget] {}
